<title>ITALY: SOCCER-BOLOGNA REACH ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLOGNA REACH ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an Italian Cup quarter-final second leg match on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Bologna 2  Cremonese 1</p>
<p>Bologna won 5-2 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
